    "/query/execute": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Map Query API"
        ],
        "summary": "Execute Query",
        "description": "Execute an ad-hoc query.\n\nThis endpoint runs a query defined entirely in the request body. Clients\ncan specify entity, selected fields, filters, joins, aggregations, sorting,\npagination, and output format.\n\nArgs:\n    req (Request): The FastAPI request context.\n    query (QueryDefinition): Query definition including entity, select\n        fields, filters, joins, aggregations, order_by, pagination,\n        and output_format (``geojson`` or ``csv``).\n\nReturns:\n    Union[QueryResult, CSVResult]:\n        - **QueryResult**: GeoJSON-compatible response with ``type``, ``meta``,\n          and ``features``.\n        - **CSVResult**: CSV data (as a string) plus ``meta``.\n\nExample:\n    **Request**\n\n    .. code-block:: json\n\n        {\n          \"entity\": \"Amp\",\n          \"select\": [\"device_eui\", {\"field\": \"status\", \"alias\": \"state\"}],\n          \"filters\": {\n            \"operator\": \"AND\",\n            \"conditions\": [\n              {\"field\": \"status\", \"op\": \"=\", \"value\": \"Offline\"},\n              {\"field\": \"is_enabled\", \"op\": \"=\", \"value\": true}\n            ]\n          },\n          \"order_by\": [\n            {\"field\": \"device_eui\", \"direction\": \"desc\"}\n          ],\n          \"pagination\": {\"limit\": 50, \"offset\": 0},\n          \"output_format\": \"geojson\"\n        }\n\n    **GeoJSON Response**\n\n    .. code-block:: json\n\n        {\n          \"type\": \"FeatureCollection\",\n          \"meta\": {\n            \"count\": 1,\n            \"columns\": [\"device_eui\", \"state\"],\n            \"pagination\": {\"limit\": 50, \"offset\": 0}\n          },\n          \"features\": [\n            {\n              \"type\": \"Feature\",\n              \"properties\": {\n                \"device_eui\": \"0102030405060101\",\n                \"state\": \"Offline\"\n              },\n              \"geometry\": null\n            }\n          ]\n        }",
        "operationId": "execute_query_query_execute_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QueryDefinition"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {

                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          },
          {
            "gatewayHeader": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
