    "/query/saved_queries/{query_id}/execute": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Map Query API"
        ],
        "summary": "Execute Saved Query",
        "description": "Execute a saved query with the given parameters.\n\nThis endpoint retrieves the saved query definition identified by ``query_id``\nand executes it using the provided execution request payload. Runtime\nparameters, pagination, sorting, and output format can all be specified.\n\nThe response format depends on ``output_format`` in the request:\n\n  * ``\"geojson\"`` → returns a :class:`QueryResult`\n  * ``\"csv\"`` → returns a :class:`CSVResult`\n\nArgs:\n    query_id (int): Unique identifier of the saved query to execute.\n    req (SavedQueryExecutionRequest): Execution parameters, including:\n        - ``params``: List of runtime parameter values to substitute into the query.\n        - ``pagination``: Limit/offset settings (default: 50/0).\n        - ``sort``: Order-by definitions.\n        - ``output_format``: Desired output format (``\"geojson\"`` or ``\"csv\"``).\n\nReturns:\n    Union[QueryResult, CSVResult]:\n        - **QueryResult**: GeoJSON-compatible response with ``type``, ``meta``,\n          and ``features``.\n        - **CSVResult**: CSV data (as a string) plus ``meta``.\n\nExample:\n\n        POST /saved_queries/42/execute\n        {\n          \"params\": [\n            {\n              \"param_name\": \"gateway\",\n              \"value\": \"0102030405060101\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"param_name\": \"status\",\n              \"value\": [\"Offline\"]\n            },\n            {\n              \"param_name\": \"is_enabled\",\n              \"value\": true\n            }\n          ],\n          \"pagination\": {\n            \"limit\": 50,\n            \"offset\": 0\n          },\n          \"sort\": [\n            { \"field\": \"Amp.device_eui\", \"direction\": \"desc\" }\n          ],\n          \"output_format\": \"geojson\"\n        }",
        "operationId": "execute_saved_query_query_saved_queries__query_id__execute_post",
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          },
          {
            "gatewayHeader": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "query_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "title": "Query Id"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SavedQueryExecutionRequest"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {

                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
